# Deliberately almost empty.
#
# Because the app calls the RELATIVE path /api (proxied by Vite in dev, nginx in the
# cluster), there is NO API URL to configure — the same build runs in every
# environment. This is on purpose, and it's why there are no VITE_API_URL variables
# scattered per environment.
#
# Reminder if you ever add one: Vite bakes VITE_* values into the JS bundle at BUILD
# time, so they can't be swapped at container start the way the backend's DB_HOST can.
# Prefer the relative-path + proxy approach over per-environment builds.
